    // here; the other 19 in that directory are auto-loaded just by being there, which is
    // why a config-only audit missed them. 18 of the 20 had never been called once in
    // 12,895 tool calls, and cost 3,767 tokens of tool definitions on every request.
    // Parked as plugins/<name>.ts.unused-20260818; restoring one is a rename.
    "openrtk",
    "./plugins/opencode-ops-patched/src/index.ts",
