        //
        // This does NOT cascade to subagents -- verified with `opencode debug agent
        // git-agent`, which still resolves all 23 github_* as true. Everything here
        // stays reachable by delegating to the agent that owns it.
        //
        // Namespaces with live tools are listed per-tool instead of globbed, so
        // these keep working: ssh_hosts(400 calls), ssh_connect(56), ssh_exec(12),
        // pc-exec(693), pc-screenshot(12), fdx-read(11), fdx-ls(6), git_context(7),
        // git_dirty(7), create_release(13).
        //
        // ctx_* is deliberately absent: Magic Context is the context engine, and
        // ctx_expand/ctx_note read as unused only because it was installed Aug 9.
        //
        // Written as `permission`, not the deprecated `tools` key. Both were tested
        // and produce an identical resolved tool map; see anomalyco/opencode#37675
        // for the global `tools` key failing to exclude tools from provider requests.
